1result.sql calculates the weekly and monthly maxima using the `base` CTE, which still contains every traffic source.  
That mixes revenues from all sources, so the “max weekly” and “max monthly” figures are not limited to the top‑performing source.  
2result.sql first filters the dataset to the chosen top source (`filtered` CTE) and then derives the daily, weekly and monthly aggregates from that restricted set, so its maxima are computed correctly.

```plaintext
2result.sql
```